+// --- Ulduar (map 603) --------------------------------------------------------
+//
+// Ulduar opens with FLAME LEVIATHAN, a siege-vehicle fight: the raid boards the
+// salvaged demolishers, siege engines and choppers at the Expedition Base Camp,
+// drives them to the Formation Grounds, kills the two Colossi at his gate (he
+// waits for them: boss_flame_leviathan's _startTimer) and fights him from the
+// vehicles. The Lightning Wall behind him (194905, DOOR_TYPE_PASSAGE) is the only
+// way into the rest of Ulduar, and it opens only on his death. Bots cannot drive
+// that fight: mod-playerbots boards a vehicle only when the bot's MASTER sits in
+// one (FlameLeviathanVehicleNearTrigger), and has no convoy, approach or ram
+// movement for one.
+//
+// THE RULING. Dungeon clear never fights, kills or credits the Leviathan: his row
+// is skipped by design. For a raid of bots ONLY — no member a person controls,
+// which is what an offline raid is — it passes him the way the instance itself
+// takes a raid past him once he is dead: the Expedition Base Camp's Ulduar
+// Teleporter (GO 194569) and its "Colossal Forge" destination, spell 64028, whose
+// spell_target_position (553.23, -12.32, 410.07) lies beyond the wall. The
+// teleporter's gossip shows that option only once the Leviathan is DONE (source
+// 15 conditions on menu 10389), so this IS a skip: no loot, no kill, no
+// achievement and no boss state change for him; every boss after him is fought
+// for real. A group a person is in keeps the gate exactly as before. Razorscale
+// is started by gossip with the Expedition Commander (npc_expedition_commander),
+// so she gets an objective in front of her and a ground anchor on the runway.
+namespace DcUlduar
+{
+    constexpr uint32 MAP_ID = 603;
+
+    // Boss slots (ulduar.h), equal to the DBC encounter indexes.
+    constexpr uint32 BOSS_LEVIATHAN  = 0;
+    constexpr uint32 BOSS_RAZORSCALE = 2;
+
+    constexpr uint32 NPC_LEVIATHAN            = 33113;
+    constexpr uint32 NPC_RAZORSCALE           = 33186;
+    constexpr uint32 NPC_EXPEDITION_COMMANDER = 33210;
+
+    constexpr uint32 GO_ULDUAR_TELEPORTER          = 194569;
+    constexpr uint32 SPELL_COLOSSAL_FORGE_TELEPORT = 64028;
+    // spell_target_position 64028, the fallback if the row is missing.
+    constexpr float FORGE_X = 553.233f, FORGE_Y = -12.324f, FORGE_Z = 410.07f, FORGE_O = 3.1765f;
+
+    // West of this is outside the Leviathan's gate: the entrance (-914, -149), the
+    // Expedition Base Camp (-806..-706) and the Formation Grounds (130..395). The
+    // gate is the Leviathan Door at x 395.06 and the Lightning Wall at 401.31;
+    // every boss after him stands at x > 550.
+    constexpr float OUTSIDE_MAX_X = 395.0f;
+
+    // Razorscale: the commander, and a ground anchor on the runway beside him (her
+    // spawn hovers at z 490 over it). The runway floor is z 391.5-391.9.
+    constexpr float COMMANDER_X = 585.667f, COMMANDER_Y = -104.448f, COMMANDER_Z = 391.6f;
+    constexpr float RUNWAY_X = 586.0f, RUNWAY_Y = -125.0f, RUNWAY_Z = 391.6f;
+
+    constexpr uint32 PASS_LOG_THROTTLE_MS = 30000;
+    constexpr uint32 COMMANDER_TIMEOUT_MS = 600000;
+
+    constexpr uint32 EVENT_LEVIATHAN_PASS = 1;  // conditional
+    constexpr uint32 EVENT_RAZORSCALE     = 2;  // anchored, just before her row
+
+    constexpr uint32 ORDER_RAZORSCALE = BOSS_RAZORSCALE;  // ties her row; objectives sort first
+
+    // ObjectiveHookRegistry id (flat space).
+    constexpr uint32 HOOK_ULD_PASS = 69;
+}
